doc:Factsarticle1_68 schema:abstract "The automotive industry constantly seeks intelligent technologies to increase competitiveness, reduce costs, and minimize waste, in line with the advancements of Industry 4.0. This study aims to implement and analyze a predictive model based on machine learning within the automotive industry, validating its capability to reduce the impact of unplanned downtime."@en .
